description: Cross-cutting patterns for routing, runtime and dates
alwaysApply: true
---

# Patterns

- Filters, sorting and pagination live in URL search params, never in React state.
- Every DB-touching route needs the Node runtime, not Edge.
  Set `export const runtime = 'nodejs'` on layouts/pages that talk to Prisma.
- Dates: store `Task.dueDate` as a calendar date at UTC midnight; store
  `Activity.occurredAt` as a true instant. Never conflate them.
- A sequence is a template, not a schedule. Only the NEXT task is ever materialised
  (see SPEC.md §0). Never materialise a full sequence up front.
